# Requests for the API (docker compose up, or `uv run chatbot-rag`).
# The last two requests call the OpenAI-compatible LLM server (Ollama) directly
# to check it is reachable and that the model supports tool calling.

@apiUrl = http://192.168.1.103:8000
@llmUrl = http://192.168.1.251:11434/v1
@model = gpt-oss:20b-200k

### LLM server: list models
GET {{llmUrl}}/models

### LLM server: say hello directly to the model (checks that it answers)
POST {{llmUrl}}/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Bonjour" }
  ]
}

### Shop incident (should return the procedure of documentations/errors-cases/basecamp-shop-chute-trafic.md)
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/handles-a-detected-error
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "contexte_incident",
  "incident_id": "2d860e55-2483-4935-9d1b-8119a7921f3d",
